'''Brains''' slide around the room erratically in the cardinal directions, leaving a trail of [[red creep]], they deal a whole heart of contact damage. When Isaac is within line of sight they will charge in his direction until they collide with an obstacle or another enemy similar to {{E|Knight}}s.
{{clear}}

