=== Pon ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Pon
 | id          = 840
 | base hp     = 20
 | environment = {{floor|Mines}}<br>{{floor|Mausoleum}}
 | behavior    = Hops around the room, leaving damaging [[red creep]] wherever it lands. Upon death, its associated {{E|Brainless Knight}} dies with it.
}}

'''Pons''' hop around erratically leaving [[red creep]] wherever they land. If close to Isaac then they will hop towards Isaac chasing him similarly to {{E|Hopper}}s.

They can spawn with a paired {{E|Brainless Knight}} in which killing them is required to kill their corresponding Brainless Knight. A Pon and a Brainless Knight pair will always spawn when {{E|Loose Knight}} is killed.

{{clear}}{{dlc clear}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|a+}} If Poison Minds aren't unlocked yet, they are replaced by Brains.

== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|r}} The [[Anti:Pon|Pon]] first appeared in the ''Antibirth'' mod where it could also appear in {{s|Depths}}.
* {{dlc|r}} The name of '''Pon''' is likely a pun in reference to the homophonic pronunciation of the [[wikipedia:Pon|Pons]] region of the brain and pawns from chess.

